From: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] plugins: add samsungipcd

Plugin for Samsung IPC modems behind the samsungipcd proxy (Galaxy J4,
Shannon SS305AP): AT over the proxy's tty, packet data over the modem
driver's rmnet0 with a static IP from AT+CGCONTRDP, no PPP. The ports
are virtual and are matched by the ID_MM_SAMSUNGIPCD tag that
samsungipcd's rules file sets.

Ported from the ModemManager 1.14 plugin (mm-plugin-samsungipcd/ in
github.com/Manoedinata/debian_j4lte) to the 1.24 built-in plugin API.

